33 pages, 6 figures; published version of results contained in the second part of arXiv:1006.0283, various new results added; Ann. Henri Poincare, 2011, online first"}],"earliest_date":"2011-10","refereed":true,"external_system_identifiers":[{"schema":"MSNET","value":"2855176"},{"schema":"ADS","value":"2011AnHP...12.1491A"},{"schema":"SPIRES","value":"SPIRES-9223479"}],"facet_author_name":["1069808_Stefanos Aretakis"],"license":[{"imposing":"arXiv","url":"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/"}],"_oai":{"sets":["Literature"],"id":"oai:inspirehep.net:931179","updated":"2026-02-06T10:43:20.528104"},"journal_title_variants":["Annales Henri Poincare"],"arxiv_eprints":[{"categories":["gr-qc"],"value":"1110.2009"}],"referenced_authors_bais":["P.T.Chrusciel.1","I.Rodnianski.1","Demetrios.Christodoulou.1","L.Nguyen.1","B.S.Kay.1","R.M.Wald.1","M.Dafermos.1"],"figures":[{"filename":"pic2ern.png","caption":"pic2ern.pdf","source":"arxiv","key":"8dd703f6c63279757720c9222aba0ce3","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/8dd703f6c63279757720c9222aba0ce3"},{"filename":"pic1ern.png","caption":"pic1ern.pdf","source":"arxiv","key":"d5c3ddb7edeb0e7c78935a9f4874ff8a","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/d5c3ddb7edeb0e7c78935a9f4874ff8a"},{"filename":"1pointdecay.png","caption":"1pointdecay.pdf","source":"arxiv","key":"7451a3c709997f6af36a141e03c1722b","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/7451a3c709997f6af36a141e03c1722b"},{"filename":"2decaypoint.png","caption":"2decaypoint.pdf","source":"arxiv","key":"7fbbdf6c4ca90df9e3a41ed410dd035a","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/7fbbdf6c4ca90df9e3a41ed410dd035a"},{"filename":"hp1.png","caption":"hp1.pdf","source":"arxiv","key":"32ecc707dd7e6886a465b7ec2b4c84f6","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/32ecc707dd7e6886a465b7ec2b4c84f6"},{"filename":"s0new.png","caption":"s0new.pdf","source":"arxiv","key":"6c1f2c682a40d683e749525673a38aa1","url":"https://inspirehep.net/files/6c1f2c682a40d683e749525673a38aa1"}],"legacy_version":"20210316095423.0","inspire_categories":[{"term":"Gravitation and Cosmology"},{"term":"Math and Math Physics"}],"first_author":{"full_name":"Aretakis, Stefanos","last_name":"Aretakis","first_name":"Stefanos","recid":1069808},"control_number":931179,"dois":[{"value":"10.1007/s00023-011-0110-7"}],"document_type":["article"],"texkeys":["Aretakis:2011hc"],"abstracts":[{"source":"arXiv","value":"This paper contains the second part of a two-part series on the stability and instability of extreme Reissner-Nordstrom spacetimes for linear scalar perturbations. We continue our study of solutions to the linear wave equation on a suitable globally hyperbolic subset of such a spacetime, arising from regular initial data prescribed on a Cauchy hypersurface crossing the future event horizon. We here obtain definitive energy and pointwise decay, non-decay and blow-up results. Our estimates hold up to and including the horizon. A hierarchy of conservations laws on degenerate horizons is also derived.","abstract_source_suggest":{"input":"arXiv"}}],"primary_arxiv_category":["gr-qc"],"titles":[{"title":"Stability and Instability of Extreme Reissner-Nordström Black Hole Spacetimes for Linear Scalar Perturbations II"},{"source":"arXiv","title":"Stability and Instability of Extreme Reissner-Nordström Black Hole Spacetimes for Linear Scalar Perturbations II"}],"curated":true},"id":"931179"},{"updated":"2026-02-06T10:43:22.076378+00:00","created":"2011-10-10T00:00:00+00:00","links":{"bibtex":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/931178?format=bibtex","latex-eu":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/931178?format=latex-eu","latex-us":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/931178?format=latex-us","json":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/931178?format=json","json-expanded":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/931178?format=json-expanded","cv":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/931178?format=cv","citations":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=refersto%3Arecid%3A931178"},"metadata":{"citation